cff-version: 1.2.0
title: AI-ALE LIMS Data Viewer
message: >-
  If you use this software or figures exported from it, please cite it using
  these metadata.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Vibhav
    family-names: Setlur
    affiliation: Argonne National Laboratory
repository-code: 'https://github.com/VibhavSetlur/ai-ale-lims-data-viewer'
abstract: >-
  A read-only web viewer over the AI-ALE (Adaptive Laboratory Evolution) LIMS
  database for the robotic ALE study of Acinetobacter baylyi ADP1. It presents
  breseq mutation calls, dgoA* copy-number amplification trajectories, robot-
  measured OD600 growth curves, and VerA/VerB barcode-composition charts, and
  exports publication-quality figures. The viewer is a presentation layer over a
  database snapshot and contains no scientific algorithms; every value shown is
  stored in the database or computed transparently from stored values.
keywords:
  - adaptive laboratory evolution
  - Acinetobacter baylyi
  - copy number variation
  - data visualization
  - LIMS
license: MIT
